  "required_path_if_a_new_test_is_authorized": [
    "Start MiniHBaseCluster and create a table with one column family.",
    "Read the descriptor through Admin; create a new descriptor with the same table name, family count, coprocessor descriptors, region replication, and memstore replication, changing only a permitted column-family property or benign table property.",
